type: software
title: "ctdcast: Shipboard CTD and LADCP HTML report generator"
abstract: "Self-contained HTML report generator for shipboard CTD and LADCP data. Produces fully self-contained HTML files (all figures embedded as base64 data URIs) for per-cast station pages, transect section pages, and cruise-wide time series pages."
